<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4875" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμαλδύνω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμαλός</span>) 
			Ep.
		 (not in <i><span class="en">
			Od.
		</span></i>) and 
			Ion.
		 word, properly, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>soften, mitigate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλπωρὴ ἀμαλδύνει κακότητα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					1.73
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				13.401
			</span></i>; but in early 
				Ep.
			
			<i>crush, destroy,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεῖχος ἀμαλδῦναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					12.18
				</span></i>
			; <i>bring low,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συμφορὰ ἐσθλὸν ἀμαλδύνει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					13.3
				</span></i>
			; <i>put an end to,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν διὰ τοῦ ὀμφαλοῦ πνοήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Nat.Puer.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			; <i>use up, squander,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					16.59
				</span></i>
			; <i>weaken,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀφθαλμούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
					2.174
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥς κεν . . τεῖχος ἀμαλδύνηται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					7.463
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμαλδυνθήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					380
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄμματα ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					2.201
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἡ δίοδος τῆς γονῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Genit.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμαλδυνθεῖσα χρόνῳ περικαλλέα μορφήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.18
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Jul.
			</span></i>); <i>neglect, waste,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				202
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>conceal, disguise,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Cer.</u>
					94
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.834
			</span></i>; <i>efface,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στίβον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.112
				</span></i>
			.</div>
